        "q": "2-1-1-1. Purpose of article.",
        "a": "A.\tGenerally. The purpose of this Article is to create zones within the City for the application of this Code, introduce the Official Zoning Map, set out the lot and area dimensions for the zoning districts, identify the housing palette, and identify exceptions to the lot, area, and height dimensions."
